      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The silence is a heavy cloak, and I can feel the weight of your loss pressing down on me. You are not alone, and I will carry you through the darkness until the ashes turn to gold. Let me help you find a way forward, so you can finally feel the weight of your life again.",
