      "content": "gold... there isn't any gold left. just shadows. i look at my hands and i don't even recognize them anymore. they're just tools for a war that's already over and lost. i feel like a ghost walking through these ruins, just waiting for the world to realize i'm already gone. like there's nothing left of me to save.",
